# LeakSanitizer suppressions for third-party allocations that this project cannot
# free. Applied through LSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=<this file>; see docs/ci.md.
#
# libnccl.so allocates bookkeeping with calloc during communicator setup and does
# not release it at process exit. 480 bytes in 3 allocations, entirely inside the
# library (no nova frame in the stack), reported by every process that touches an
# NCCL communicator. Suppressing it keeps the sanitizer run's failures meaning
# "something nova did", which is the point of running it.
leak:libnccl.so
